 R←Test_SendEmail_20(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;res;parts
⍝ Exercise the SendEmailExample function, with and without an attachment
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Clear
 res←∆NewParms SMTP.SendEmailExample'john.doe@example.com'
 →T.PassesIf'Email was sent successfully'≡res
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Messages
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'RCPT TO: <john.doe@example.com>')∊∆SERVER.Commands

 ∆SERVER.Clear
 res←∆NewParms SMTP.SendEmailExample'john.doe@example.com' './Test-Files/sample.txt'
 →T.PassesIf'Email was sent successfully'≡res
 parts←∆MimeParts ∆Unstuff⊃∆SERVER.Messages
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢parts
 →T.PassesIf(∆ReadBytes'./Test-Files/sample.txt')≡∆PartBytes 2⊃parts

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
